{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"Kundschafter des Friedens","Die pensionierten DDR-Spione haben gerade ihren alten Mentor auf Kuba beigesetzt als sie sich vornehmen, die letzte noch wirkliche Bastion des Sozialismus zu retten. Doch mit ihrem bisher größten Gegner haben sie nicht gerechnet: Vollpension und Cuba Libre. (Around 1860, Louis, a photographer, convinces a general of the French army to send him to Mexico to photograph the colonial war which is ravaging the country. Once he is there, nothing goes as planned. Never at the right place at the right time to see the battles, Louis can't get a single picture of the war. But his encounter with Pinto, a Mexican peasant, changes his destiny. It leads him to discover neither glory nor wealth, but a way to confront the ghosts of his past.)",[4,5,6,7,8],"rescue mission","mentorship","elderhood","cultural memory","activism",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":15,"filmType":19,"directors":20,"genre":29,"media":32,"synopsis":35,"production":38,"characters":41,"roles":94,"awards":164,"tags":3},"Film","DE2017_007","de2017-007-kundschafter-des-friedens",{"native":1,"english":14},"",{"type":16,"date":17,"year":18},"Theatrical release","2017-01-26",2017,"Fiction film",[21],{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":28},"Robert Thalheim","robert-thalheim",1974,0,"Male identifying","Germany",[],[30,31],"Comedy","Action",{"posterUrl":33,"trailerUrl":34},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5076054/mediaviewer/rm936183296/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YEdzz3vQ6Xs&ab_channel=RobertHofmann",{"native":36,"english":37},"Die pensionierten DDR-Spione haben gerade ihren alten Mentor auf Kuba beigesetzt als sie sich vornehmen, die letzte noch wirkliche Bastion des Sozialismus zu retten. Doch mit ihrem bisher größten Gegner haben sie nicht gerechnet: Vollpension und Cuba Libre.","Around 1860, Louis, a 